       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPS12A RECURSIVE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  TOTAL-CALLS PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SAVED-N PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  CHILD-N PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  CHILD-RESULT PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  ARG-N PIC S9(9) COMP.
       01  RESULT-N PIC S9(9) COMP.
       01  CALLS-N PIC 9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ARG-N RESULT-N CALLS-N.
           ADD 1 TO TOTAL-CALLS.
           MOVE ARG-N TO SAVED-N.
           PERFORM RECURSE-WORK.
           MOVE TOTAL-CALLS TO CALLS-N.
           GOBACK.
       RECURSE-WORK.
           IF SAVED-N = 0
               MOVE 0 TO RESULT-N
           ELSE
               COMPUTE CHILD-N = SAVED-N - 1
               CALL 'ZPS12A' USING CHILD-N CHILD-RESULT CALLS-N
               COMPUTE RESULT-N = SAVED-N + CHILD-RESULT
           END-IF.
       END PROGRAM ZPS12A.
